WEBVTT

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.980
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.210
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:26.050
What's wrong?

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:28.970
Quiet, Princess.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:37.450
Let's go!

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:40.480
Leave them to me!

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:42.520
You take that path!

00:02:57.270 --> 00:02:59.140
What a fool.

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:03.710
What is a <i>yokai</i> doing helping humans?

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:05.750
Are you a <i>yokai</i>, too?

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:09.090
Human or <i>yokai</i>, it matters not.

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:10.700
Begone with you.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:15.740
CHAPTER 17

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:20.770
KANI-BOZU AND THE ANCIENT MYSTERY

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:29.280
I can still go on drinking all night!

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:33.360
Huh?

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:38.540
Eight legs all together...
Moving sideways...

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:40.670
My eyes look to the heavens...

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:42.640
What am I?

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:44.960
What?

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:46.670
Answer.

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:50.680
What are you, whoops, talking about?

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:52.430
You don't know.

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:54.130
In that case!

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:08.070
Dad, shouldn't you put on some sunscreen?

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:10.490
We've come all the way to the ocean.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:14.160
Why don't you try
letting your skin tan, Kitaro?

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:19.060
Daddy Eyeball-san,
even your eyeball's tan. Are you okay?

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:22.290
The sun's a little bright.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.790
Wally Wall, could you move a bit closer?

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.300
Wally Wall.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.730
Thank you.

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:33.050
You came all this way
and you're still drinking?!

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:37.740
Perfect for the summer ocean,
this is a cocktail called Blue Hawaii.

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:41.730
Huh? Where's Rollo Cloth-san?

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:43.940
I'm right here!

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:45.230
Oh no!

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:46.940
What do ya mean, "oh no"?!

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:50.550
I'd rather be a girl's swimsuit!

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:52.150
Hey!

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:56.160
I got the leftover crab
from yesterday's festival!

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:59.750
Man, the town of Sakaiminato is the best!

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:02.000
Maybe I'll live here.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:07.130
You shouldn't, Rat Man. You'll be
a nuisance to the people of Sakaiminato.

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:09.000
Huh? Where's Rollo Cloth?

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:13.430
He said he's going off
to find some scallops.

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:15.340
I love scallops, too!

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:18.910
You can't catch scallops
in Sakaiminato, can you?

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:26.120
He said he absolutely had to make
a seashell swimsuit for Catchick to wear.

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:28.400
I'll maim him!

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:29.860
Scary...

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:31.650
I'll wear it!

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:33.360
What?!

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:36.360
What is that?!

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:39.030
Rollo Cloth!

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:41.870
But, this isn't cotton, it's...

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.220
Iron?

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:47.210
It's not iron, it looks like bronze.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.520
What happened here?

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:57.030
Is something wrong?

00:05:58.280 --> 00:05:59.800
Kinopee-san was...

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:04.350
This is...

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:06.520
The same as Rollo Cloth...

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:11.440
Tell us, Kitaro-san,
is this also the work of an evil <i>yokai</i>?

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:14.190
Kinopee!

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:19.070
It's slight, but I sense <i>yokai</i> activity.

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:21.090
This was probably a <i>yokai</i>'s doing...

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:26.270
HANDMADE GOODS STORE

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:29.210
They're finding people who have been
turned to bronze all over town.

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:29.600
TEMPORARILY CLOSED TODAY

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:32.210
There are strange rumors
going around, too.

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:34.110
WE WILL BE CLOSED FOR THE TIME BEING

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:34.170
Strange rumors?

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:40.260
Like if you touch someone turned to bronze
you'll turn to bronze within 24 hours.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:44.260
Or that it's an illness called "bronzitis"
and is airborne...

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:48.520
Everyone's scared
and holed up in their homes.

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:50.920
We better do something soon...

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:54.520
So there's such a rumor...

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:58.320
It's the perfect opportunity
for making money!

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:00.400
I better act quickly.

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:05.810
The best idea here would probably be
to sell fake medicine.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:09.420
"Take one a day to prevent bronzitis."

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:11.980
Something like "bronze-be-gone pills"!

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:16.720
If I roll up some boogers,
it'll cost me nothing.

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:18.840
Take one after breakfast, lunch,
and dinner.

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:22.070
Plus one before snack time
for good measure.

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:25.740
As for the price...

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.640
10,000 yen per pill.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:30.930
Plus sales tax, if I sell at 10,800 yen...

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.700
Welcome back.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.410
Where's Sand Witch?

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:51.250
She go buy sweet potato <i>shochu</i>.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:56.170
Rollo Cloth favorite sake.
Pour on and maybe fix.

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:59.590
Come to think of it, Rat Man's gone, too.

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:02.170
He's not up to something again is he?!

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:06.370
Who are you?!

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:12.190
Eight legs all together...
Moving sideways...

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:14.230
My eyes look to the heavens...

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:15.980
What am I?

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:17.110
Huh?

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:19.440
Is it a riddle?

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.070
Answer.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:24.910
Eight legs means it's an octopus!

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:26.260
No!

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:33.080
So it's your doing!

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:35.080
Hair Needles!

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:41.220
Watch out, Kitaro!

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:42.460
Answer!

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:44.600
Centipede.

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:45.700
No!

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:52.930
A centipede has a hundred legs, not eight!

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.310
Hair Spear!

00:08:58.360 --> 00:08:59.500
What?!

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:01.990
Now answer.

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:05.320
Eight legs all together...
Moving sideways...

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:08.240
My eyes look to the heavens...
What am I?

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:09.910
I've got it! The answer is--

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.240
Don't, Catchick!

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:12.920
Don't answer him!

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:15.750
Answer wrong
and you'll be turned to bronze.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.750
It's okay. I just have to be right then.

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:23.050
Eight legs, walks sideways,
and its eyes face upwards.

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:24.510
The answer is...

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:25.720
A crab!

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:27.010
No!

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.660
Catchick!

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:33.850
Thank you, Shoji-san.

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:35.270
It's nothing.

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:37.830
Now go take that to him.

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:41.630
I brought the sweet potato <i>shochu</i>!

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:47.530
Sand Witch, stay back!

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:53.990
Kitaro!

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:56.330
Princess?

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:00.800
Princess...

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.340
Princess, is that you?

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:04.780
Wh-Who are you?

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:08.340
Sand Witch, we should run for now!

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:12.120
Quickly! Drive!

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:13.310
What's wrong?

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:15.830
Just drive!

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:31.350
Princess...

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:36.120
MUZUKI SHIGERU ROAD IN THE AFTERNOON
(SAKAIMINATO CITY, TOTTORI)

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:40.620
MUZUKI SHIGERU ROAD AT NIGHT
(SAKAIMINATO CITY, TOTTORI)

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:39.560
<i>"-Oh, what should I do?"
-"I was sleeping."</i>

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:40.560
<i>"Huh?!"</i>

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:46.090
It sounded like
he called Sand Witch, "Princess."

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:48.340
Do you know him?

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:51.560
He's got the wrong person,
or rather, the wrong <i>yokai</i>.

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:55.350
I don't know any <i>yokai</i> like that.

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:58.850
Kitaro, Cat-san and the others
were turned to bronze?

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:02.480
A lot of the townspeople got turned, too.

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:04.570
What should we do?

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:06.420
Hmm...

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:09.910
Perhaps the Karasu-Tengu of Daisen...

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:11.370
The Karasu-Tengu?

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:12.490
That's right.

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:18.210
They've lived for 1,300 years on Japan's
oldest sacred mountain, Daisen.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:22.270
The Karasu-Tengu tribe
might know something.

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.590
All right. Let's go.

00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:27.500
We can reach the pass by car
in about an hour.

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:31.990
I found you.

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:33.660
Princess...

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:36.100
He followed you?

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:37.390
Mana, the back door!

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:48.280
Eight legs all together...
Moving sideways...

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:50.360
My eyes look to the heavens...

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:52.110
What am I?

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:56.720
-Who cares, you bastard!
-No!

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.170
Uncle Shoji!

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.040
This way!

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:02.920
But...!

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:06.150
You'll be turned to bronze, too! Run!

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:07.710
Princess!

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:10.210
Stop!

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:23.560
Uncle Shoji, I promise
we'll come back to save you!

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:26.770
Take us to the Karasu-Tengu!

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:35.530
Hey! Are there any Karasu-Tengu here?

00:12:38.010 --> 00:12:39.370
Hey!

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:42.870
Mana, watch your step!

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:53.050
Are you hurt at all?

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:55.300
Th-Thank you.

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:59.990
Um, who are you?

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:03.810
P-Please excuse me!

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:07.270
I'm Kojiro the Karasu-Tengu.

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:12.740
Oh, but if the elder finds out, he'll
scold me, so please keep this a secret.

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:14.420
Hey!

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:19.580
Help me, too! Help me!

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.750
I see...

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:27.840
The one doing it is probably him.

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:30.000
Who's "him"?

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:33.610
When was it, I don't remember exactly...

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:36.800
The time was of the warring states.

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:42.730
In a small state, there was a <i>yokai</i>
who served humans named Kani-Bozu.

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:47.600
Kani-Bozu fought to protect a princess
who had lost and was fleeing.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:52.360
They hid in
a mountain shrine in Sakaiminato.

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:55.030
But enemies could come at any time.

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:59.990
And so, to determine if anyone approaching
the princess was friend or foe,

00:13:59.990 --> 00:14:01.830
he would ask this...

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:06.380
Eight legs all together...
Moving sideways...

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:08.540
My eyes look to the heavens...

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:10.210
What am I?

00:14:10.690 --> 00:14:14.260
Their allies all knew who Kani-Bozu was.

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:15.510
In other words,

00:14:15.510 --> 00:14:19.760
those who didn't know
were enemies after the princess.

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:25.600
Kani-Bozu turned their pursuers
into bronze, one after another.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:30.000
But, that didn't last for long.

00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:37.630
A powerful wizard hired by their enemies
sealed Kani-Bozu away.

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:45.430
Eventually, the fleeing princess
lost her life in Sakaiminato.

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:48.290
I see...

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:52.380
Kani-Bozu returned to present day
after being sealed away.

00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:56.300
But, not knowing
how many centuries have passed,

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:59.200
to protect that princess...

00:15:00.340 --> 00:15:02.930
Considering how the town has changed,

00:15:02.930 --> 00:15:07.730
he should be aware that
at least some time has passed.

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:09.370
Princess...

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:14.920
Sand Witch-san, you must
look like that princess.

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:20.620
A <i>yokai</i> shouldn't stick its nose in
the conflicts of foolish humans.

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:24.510
I warned him time and time again...

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:27.330
Well, there you have it.

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:29.670
Now you know so go home.

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:34.460
The Karasu-Tengu tribe doesn't get
involved with pointless conflicts.

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:36.630
We never have. We never will.

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:41.340
Wait! Could you at least tell us
how to restore those turned to bronze--

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:48.470
What should we do?

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:54.110
Is there even a way to restore
the people turned to bronze?

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:57.960
If you use the sacred water of Daisen,
it might work.

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:00.160
You!

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:04.620
What are you doing? Won't the elder
scold you if you get involved with us?

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:08.220
I don't care if I get scolded.

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:10.770
The elder is too stubborn.

00:16:12.600 --> 00:16:14.450
The sacred water of Daisen.

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:16.060
If you use this water...

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:19.010
They'll be restored?

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:22.300
Yes. There's at least a chance of it.

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:25.890
I'm not strong enough to
carry a lot at once.

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:28.140
Let's start out with this to see.

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:33.420
Thank you, Kojiro-san.

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:35.310
N-No problem...

00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:45.470
Honestly, that Kojiro...

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:49.160
I'll pour it now.

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:56.250
What was I doing?

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:58.190
You're back to normal!

00:16:58.570 --> 00:16:59.860
Mana!

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:02.680
K-Karasu-Tengu?!

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:05.890
My name is Kojiro.
I'm glad you're all right.

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:09.640
It looks like the sacred water
works like a charm.

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:12.270
Let's carry sacred water from Daisen.

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:16.020
Will the townspeople be willing to help?

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:19.030
We'll ask them, too! Right?

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:21.860
Right! I'm not sure what's going on,
but I got this!

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:25.800
Princess!

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:30.750
I'm not your princess.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.540
Wake up already!

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:35.460
You've been asleep for centuries!

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:38.210
The world has changed since then.

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:42.050
The princess you protected
is no longer of this world!

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:44.470
That's a lie! You can't fool me!

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:46.220
It's not a lie!

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:49.260
You already know it, don't you?

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:52.230
You know it, but don't want to believe it!

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:55.400
Silence! That's not possible!

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:58.230
Lies! Lies, lies, lies!

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:00.730
I tell you, I'm not lying.

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:03.860
It's sad, I know,
but you have to accept reality.

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:05.660
Then answer this.

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:08.700
My name, the one who
protected the princess for so long.

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:13.120
Eight legs all together. Moving sideways.
My eyes look to the heavens.

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:14.890
What am I?

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:18.420
If what you say is the truth,

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:22.920
then you should know everything.
Who I am and what my name is!

00:18:22.920 --> 00:18:26.010
Now answer if you can! Now!

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:29.620
That's enough. Be at peace.

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:33.390
Kani-Bozu...

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:46.200
It's not true!

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:48.740
Lies, lies! Princess!

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:49.660
Dear god...

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.910
You and your uncle stay here, Mana-san!

00:18:54.930 --> 00:18:56.790
Calm yourself, Kani-Bozu!

00:18:58.020 --> 00:18:59.750
Kani-Bozu, stop!

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:01.400
Flame Sand!

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:08.800
Oh no!

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:13.890
Oh very well...

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:31.780
Princess!

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:47.820
Internal Electricity!

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:02.600
Glad I made it in time.

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:25.110
Please hear my last wish.

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:31.820
In this town where the princess rests...

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:36.120
Let me be with her...

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:40.080
Kani-Bozu...

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:49.860
Perhaps Kani-Bozu went berserk on purpose,
hoping someone would defeat him...

00:20:54.970 --> 00:20:57.870
And so, the <i>yokai</i>, Kani-Bozu,

00:20:57.870 --> 00:21:03.830
went to sleep as a bronze statue in this
town where the princess he loved rests.

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:10.050
We made the other <i>yokai</i> statues
so that Kani-Bozu wouldn't feel lonely.

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:11.460
Take your time and enjoy.

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:15.890
<i>And so, the town of Sakaiminato
that I love</i>

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:19.580
<i>was decorated with</i>
<i>wonderful bronze statues of </i>yokai<i>.</i>

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:21.160
Oh!

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:23.850
Everyone, come see them!

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:26.230
Kojiro.

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:33.240
Getting involved with the humans is fine,
but don't end up like Kani-Bozu.

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:34.590
I know that!

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:39.450
He was an unfortunate <i>yokai</i>
when you think about it...

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:41.250
Wait. More importantly,

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:45.170
there's the issue of Sand Witch
being mistaken for a princess!

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:47.540
Yeah. I still can't believe it.

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:50.630
Oh shut up. You want me to kiss you?

00:21:51.190 --> 00:21:54.180
Come to think of it, where did Rat Man go?

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:56.130
Oh! Could he be...

